# Pantry web environment schema (Varlock).
# https://varlock.dev/guides/schema/
#
# Values live in packages/env/ (see packages/env/README.md). Web still reads the
# database directly, so it picks only the libSQL connection. The docker compose keys
# (TURSO_PORT / TURSO_PROJECT) live in local-libsql/.env.schema so they stay out of
# the production Worker env. Better Auth runs in @pantry/api (reached via the API
# service binding), so web does not pick BETTER_AUTH_*.
# @import(../../packages/env/, pick=[APP_ENV, TURSO_CONNECTION_URL, TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN])
# ---
